          "label": "1",
          "sub_label": "أ",
          "statement": "تحقق أنه من أجل كل عدد طبيعي $n$: $u_{n+1} = -\\frac{11}{4} + \\frac{27}{4(-4u_n + 1)}$.",
          "marks": 0.25,
          "depends_on": [],
          "solution": "$u_{n+1} = \\frac{11u_n + 4}{-4u_n + 1} = \\frac{-\\frac{11}{4}(-4u_n + 1) + \\frac{11}{4} + 4}{-4u_n + 1} = -\\frac{11}{4} + \\frac{27/4}{-4u_n + 1} = -\\frac{11}{4} + \\frac{27}{4(-4u_n + 1)}$",
          "ordering": 1,
          "metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-4890-9b0c-1d2e3f4a5b6c",
          "exercise_id": "76894321-a1b2-4c3d-8e9f-0a1b2c3d4e5f",
          "label": "1",
          "sub_label": "ب",
          "statement": "برهن بالتراجع أنه من أجل كل عدد طبيعي $n$: $-2 < u_n < -1$.",
          "marks": 0.5,
          "depends_on": [],
          "solution": "التحقق من أجل $n=0$: $-2 < -1.5 < -1$ محققة. نفرض صحتها من أجل $n$ ونبرهنها من أجل $n+1$.",
          "ordering": 2,
          "metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "c3d4e5f6-a7b8-4901-0c1d-2e3f4a5b6c7d",
          "exercise_id": "76894321-a1b2-4c3d-8e9f-0a1b2c3d4e5f",
          "label": "1",
          "sub_label": "جـ",
          "statement": "بيّن أن المتتالية $(u_n)$ متناقصة تماما ثم استنتج أنها متقاربة.",
          "marks": 0.5,
          "depends_on": [
            "1-b"
          ],
          "solution": "$u_{n+1} - u_n = \\frac{4u_n^2 + 10u_n + 4}{-4u_n + 1} = \\frac{2(2u_n+1)(u_n+2)}{-4u_n+1}$. بما أن $-2 < u_n < -1$ فإن الفرق سالب، المتتالية متناقصة ومحدودة من الأسفل فهي متقاربة.",
          "ordering": 3,
          "metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "d4e5f6a7-b8c9-4012-1d2e-3f4a5b6c7d8e",
          "exercise_id": "76894321-a1b2-4c3d-8e9f-0a1b2c3d4e5f",
          "label": "2",
          "sub_label": "أ",
          "statement": "المتتالية العددية $(v_n)$ معرفة من أجل كل عدد طبيعي $n$ بـ: $v_n = \\frac{2u_n + 1}{u_n + 2}$. بيّن أن المتتالية $(v_n)$ هندسية أساسها 3 ثم احسب حدها الأول.",
          "marks": 0.75,
          "depends_on": [],
          "solution": "$v_{n+1} = \\frac{2u_{n+1} + 1}{u_{n+1} + 2} = 3 v_n$. الأساس $q=3$ والحد الأول $v_0 = \\frac{2(-1.5)+1}{-1.5+2} = -4$.",
          "ordering": 4,
          "metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "e5f6a7b8-c9d0-4123-2e3f-4a5b6c7d8e9f",
          "exercise_id": "76894321-a1b2-4c3d-8e9f-0a1b2c3d4e5f",
          "label": "2",
          "sub_label": "ب",
          "statement": "اكتب $v_n$ بدلالة $n$ ثم استنتج أنه من أجل كل عدد طبيعي $n$: $u_n = \\frac{3}{2 + 4 \\times 3^n} - 2$.",
          "marks": 0.75,
          "depends_on": [
            "2-a"
          ],
          "solution": "$v_n = -4 \\times 3^n$. من $v_n = \\frac{2u_n+1}{u_n+2}$ نجد $u_n = \\frac{1-2v_n}{v_n-2} = \\frac{1+8 \\times 3^n}{-4 \\times 3^n - 2} = \\frac{3}{2+4 \\times 3^n} - 2$.",
          "ordering": 5,
          "metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "f6a7b8c9-d0e1-4234-3f4a-5b6c7d8e9f0a",
          "exercise_id": "76894321-a1b2-4c3d-8e9f-0a1b2c3d4e5f",
          "label": "2",
          "sub_label": "جـ",
          "statement": "احسب $\\lim_{n \\to +\\infty} u_n$.",
          "marks": 0.25,
          "depends_on": [
            "2-b"
          ],
          "solution": "$\\lim_{n \\to +\\infty} u_n = -2$ لأن $\\lim_{n \\to +\\infty} 3^n = +\\infty$.",
          "ordering": 6,
          "metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "a7b8c9d0-e1f2-4345-4a5b-6c7d8e9f0a1b",
          "exercise_id": "76894321-a1b2-4c3d-8e9f-0a1b2c3d4e5f",
          "label": "3",
          "sub_label": "أ",
          "statement": "تحقق أنه من أجل كل عدد طبيعي $n$: $\\frac{3}{u_n + 2} - 2 = -v_n$.",
          "marks": 0.25,
          "depends_on": [],
          "solution": "$\\frac{3}{u_n+2} - 2 = \\frac{3-2u_n-4}{u_n+2} = \\frac{-2u_n-1}{u_n+2} = -v_n$.",
          "ordering": 7,
          "metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "b8c9d0e1-f2a3-4456-5b6c-7d8e9f0a1b2c",
          "exercise_id": "76894321-a1b2-4c3d-8e9f-0a1b2c3d4e5f",
          "label": "3",
          "sub_label": "ب",
          "statement": "نضع من أجل كل عدد طبيعي $n$: $S_n = \\ln(\\frac{3}{u_0 + 2} - 2) + \\ln(\\frac{3}{u_1 + 2} - 2) + \\dots + \\ln(\\frac{3}{u_n + 2} - 2)$. احسب $S_n$ بدلالة $n$.",
          "marks": 0.5,
          "depends_on": [
            "3-a"
          ],
          "solution": "$S_n = \\ln(-v_0) + \\ln(-v_1) + \\dots + \\ln(-v_n) = \\ln((-v_0)(-v_1)\\dots(-v_n)) = \\ln(4^{n+1} \\times 3^{\\frac{n(n+1)}{2}}) = (n+1)\\ln 4 + \\frac{n(n+1)}{2}\\ln 3$.",
          "ordering": 8,
          "metadata": {}
        }
      ]
